  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in sq. units) covered by <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math> with the coordinate axes is (where,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"> <mo>&#8901;</mo> </mfenced></mrow> </math> is the greatest integer function)"
