  "solution": {
    "text": "As,&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0061_d4e15567a342.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.34028in;height:1.87361in\" /><br />Hence, the required area is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> sq. units"
  }
